syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-29T06:08:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T06:08:20Z","body":"> Note that when launching in portrait, the Display scale value from the Settings shows Auto (180%).\nWhen launching in landscape, the value instead shows Auto (168%).\n\nSmaller dimension is always used when calculating scale, that's why in landscape display height is used to calculate the scale and in portrait, display width. You are seeing different `auto scale` because in landscape screen height is slightly less due to navigation bar.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5113873962/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5209097839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121726#issuecomment-5209097839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121726","id":5209097839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNnyGbw","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","event